WEBVTT

00:07:00.374 --> 00:07:02.418
Construction and construction management

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:05.629
are also among the fastest
growing jobs for women

00:07:05.671 --> 00:07:08.424
with clear paths
into advancement and leadership.

00:07:09.467 --> 00:07:10.718
These are also jobs

00:07:10.759 --> 00:07:12.970
with learn-while-you-earn
training programs,

00:07:13.012 --> 00:07:18.100
making them financially feasible careers
to enter or to transition into.

00:07:19.393 --> 00:07:21.270
(Drill whirrs)